  "body": "Right now, https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#permission-api-integration defines the `\"bluetooth\"` permission, and https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/scanning.html#permission defines `\"bluetooth-le-scan\"`. It's likely we'll have other Bluetooth permissions in the future:\n- advertising\n- defining a GATT server\n- communicating over RFCOMM\n\nI'm thinking it doesn't make a lot of sense to use `\"bluetooth\"` to refer to just the GATT-client part. Maybe `\"bluetooth-gatt-client\"` or `\"bluetooth-gatt-communication\"`?\n",
